Subject: [PATCH 2430/3799] soh: rename func_80ADEA5C -> EnPoh_TurnTowardHome

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: re-aims the drift heading at the home position once the poe strays past 400 units, and steps the yaw onto it
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
index 33aefa2b3..52c3ee908 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
@@ -484,7 +484,8 @@ void EnPoh_MoveTowardsPlayerHeight(EnPoh* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80ADEA5C(EnPoh* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ADEA5C: re-aims the drift heading at the home position once the poe strays past 400 units, and steps the yaw onto it
+void EnPoh_TurnTowardHome(EnPoh* this) {
     if (Actor_WorldDistXZToPoint(&this->actor, &this->actor.home.pos) > 400.0f) {
         this->unk_19C = Actor_WorldYawTowardPoint(&this->actor, &this->actor.home.pos);
     }
@@ -513,7 +514,7 @@ void EnPoh_Idle(EnPoh* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (Animation_OnFrame(&this->skelAnime, 0.0f) && this->unk_198 != 0) {
         this->unk_198--;
     }
-    func_80ADEA5C(this);
+    EnPoh_TurnTowardHome(this);  // was func_80ADEA5C [LLM:HIGH]
     EnPoh_MoveTowardsPlayerHeight(this, play);
     if (this->actor.xzDistToPlayer < 200.0f && this->unk_198 < 19) {
         EnPoh_SetupApproach(this);  // was func_80ADE1BC [LLM:HIGH]
